::  name       tube manifest field count
::  shape      fields - int (@u32)
::  invariant  the TUBE app-manifest mold (landed as the elder tube0 rung) carries four fields: name - version - capabilities - iteration-bound
::  example    4
::  readers    Pool - TUBE - Surface app room
::  nib        surface-p19-v0
::
::  Surface Chapter p19 -- second pedestal in src/app (Pool agents).
::  Names the TUBE app-manifest mold field count from docs/TUBE.md.
::  Does not seat packaging - APK - NativeActivity - or revive pond/apps.
::  Source: linengrow/tube_manifest.rye -- the parameters of build(), which is where the
::  mold's four fields are named. The Manifest struct itself holds seven, since a fixed
::  buffer carries a length companion beside each of its two text fields.
